    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu narongora umugeni akaryamana na we, akamwanga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamurega ibiteye isoni, akamwita izina ribi ati “Narongoye uyu mugeni mwegereye nsanga atagira ibimenyetso byerekana ko ari umwari”, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maze se na nyina b'uwo mukobwa bajyane ibimenyetso by'uko ari umwari, babishyire abakuru b'umudugudu wabo, mu marembo yawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se w'uwo mukobwa abwire abakuru ati “Uyu mugabo namushyingiye umukobwa wanjye none aramwanze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi dore amureze ibiteye isoni ati ‘Sinasanganye umukobwa wawe ibimenyetso by'uko ari umwari.’ Ariko ibimenyetso by'ibyo ngibi.” Basase uwo mwenda imbere y'abakuru b'umudugudu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuru b'uwo mudugudu bafate uwo mugabo bamukubite, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bamuce icyiru cya shekeli z'ifeza ijana bazihe se w'uwo mukobwa, bamuhoye yuko yise umwari w'Abisirayeli izina ribi, na we abe umugore we, ntazamwirukane mu gihe akiriho cyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko icyo kirego niba ari icy'ukuri, uwo mukobwa atabonetseho ibimenyetso by'uko ari umwari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
